{"4865940":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Stash Grabber","steam_appid":4865940,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4884120],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in the vault. Now get out.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most heist stories end once the thief reaches the money. Stash Grabber starts there. Each level puts you inside the vault next to the loot, and your job is to carry it back out through the rest of the bank. Some levels have one bag and others have several, and you need every one before you leave.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement and throwing<\/strong><br>Run, jump, crouch and slide, and charge up throws to land the loot where you want it. You don't get weapons or gadgets. Getting out comes down to keeping your speed up and picking the right moment to jump.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>72 levels across 8 jobs<\/strong><br>Each job adds one new idea and then mixes it with what you've already seen. The early levels teach the basics. Later ones add height, hazards, security systems and heavy loot, and the last job uses all of it at once.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting around<\/strong><br>Bounce pads, wall jumps, wind tunnels and moving platforms. A lot of routes go up before they go out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security<\/strong><br>Lasers sweep the rooms, cameras pan back and forth, and an alarm meter fills when you're spotted. There are also killswitches, pressure plates and gates that slam shut. Watch the patterns before you commit to a run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy loot<\/strong><br>Some bags are too heavy to throw. You carry them, drop them on pressure plates to open gates, and then try to get through before the gates close.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways out<\/strong><br>Every level has a main route that most players will find on a first attempt. There's usually a quicker, riskier route as well, for anyone going after a better time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your own levels<\/strong><br>The level editor is included. Share your levels and play other people's through Steam Workshop.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in the vault. Now get out.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most heist stories end once the thief reaches the money. Stash Grabber starts there. Each level puts you inside the vault next to the loot, and your job is to carry it back out through the rest of the bank. Some levels have one bag and others have several, and you need every one before you leave.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement and throwing<\/strong><br>Run, jump, crouch and slide, and charge up throws to land the loot where you want it. You don't get weapons or gadgets. Getting out comes down to keeping your speed up and picking the right moment to jump.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>72 levels across 8 jobs<\/strong><br>Each job adds one new idea and then mixes it with what you've already seen. The early levels teach the basics. Later ones add height, hazards, security systems and heavy loot, and the last job uses all of it at once.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting around<\/strong><br>Bounce pads, wall jumps, wind tunnels and moving platforms. A lot of routes go up before they go out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security<\/strong><br>Lasers sweep the rooms, cameras pan back and forth, and an alarm meter fills when you're spotted. There are also killswitches, pressure plates and gates that slam shut. Watch the patterns before you commit to a run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy loot<\/strong><br>Some bags are too heavy to throw. You carry them, drop them on pressure plates to open gates, and then try to get through before the gates close.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways out<\/strong><br>Every level has a main route that most players will find on a first attempt. There's usually a quicker, riskier route as well, for anyone going after a better time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your own levels<\/strong><br>The level editor is included. Share your levels and play other people's through Steam Workshop.<\/p>","short_description":"Start inside the vault with the cash, then get out of the building. Stash Grabber is a physics platformer about heists in reverse: 72 levels of lasers, cameras, bounce pads and pressure plates, with a safe route for getting out alive and a faster one for chasing times.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/702e6debe9fd80ca6e2807a49053c06d13d6dea5\/header.jpg?t=1793679348","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/2145047f294cc0f2f0205197251603ae0a9b4d6b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793679348","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/2145047f294cc0f2f0205197251603ae0a9b4d6b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793679348","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core x86-64 @ 2.4 GHz (i3-class)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> D3D12-capable, 2 GB VRAM (GTX 1050 \/ RX 560 \/ UHD 630)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core @ 3.0 GHz (i5 \/ Ryzen 5)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated 4 GB VRAM (GTX 1660 \/ RTX 2060 \/ RX 580)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 64-bit, ~2020+ (Ubuntu 20.04 \/ SteamOS 3)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> \tDual-core x86-64 @ 2.4 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.0, 2 GB VRAM, current driver (Mesa ≥ 20.3 \/ NVIDIA proprietary)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 \/ SteamOS 3+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core @ 3.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.2, dedicated 4 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["Alterr Games"],"publishers":["Alterr Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":1025,"final":717,"discount_percent":30,"initial_formatted":"10,25€","final_formatted":"7,17€"},"packages":[1689912],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Stash Grabber","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1689912,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Stash Grabber - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">10,25€<\/span> 7,17€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":717}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":true},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":30,"description":"Steam Workshop"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":17,"description":"Includes level editor"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/0402dc03313eb25b4950fe6e6d6004491da815bb\/ss_0402dc03313eb25b4950fe6e6d6004491da815bb.600x338.jpg?t=1793679348","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/0402dc03313eb25b4950fe6e6d6004491da815bb\/ss_0402dc03313eb25b4950fe6e6d6004491da815bb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793679348"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/db3e1f3ca0a81d0149b1c9f0671d8deb09282e64\/ss_db3e1f3ca0a81d0149b1c9f0671d8deb09282e64.600x338.jpg?t=1793679348","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/db3e1f3ca0a81d0149b1c9f0671d8deb09282e64\/ss_db3e1f3ca0a81d0149b1c9f0671d8deb09282e64.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793679348"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/b72834a7e0eef50d78f1e402d68ee48859a31a42\/ss_b72834a7e0eef50d78f1e402d68ee48859a31a42.600x338.jpg?t=1793679348","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/b72834a7e0eef50d78f1e402d68ee48859a31a42\/ss_b72834a7e0eef50d78f1e402d68ee48859a31a42.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793679348"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4865940\/7ec37efa